    "created_at": "2018-04-11T21:16:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-04-11T21:16:27Z",
    "body": "Hi, I'm Chris, and I'd like to start getting involved with OpenFermion.\r\n\r\nHas this issue been resolved? It seems as though `SymbolicOperator` already has a `__str__` implementation defined which gives a human-readable string representation of the operator?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
