    "created_at": "2018-04-13T22:05:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-04-13T22:10:04Z",
    "body": "I actually just wanted to be able to save and load using the `__str__` method. I was intending to use this only for small operators which I sometimes want revisit and inspect visually. Now that I think of it, I don't really care about loading from such a format, but only saving. I think simply adding an option to save and load a text file using the `__str__` method is a good solution.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
