    "created_at": "2018-04-14T01:24:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-04-14T01:26:10Z",
    "body": "Currently we have no mechanism for saving and loading FermionOperators and QubitOperators, right? I think the idea was literally just to have a function for saving and loading to/from a text file that is a dump of what comes out when you call  `repr(my_op)`.\r\n\r\nThis is not the most numerically performant option, but it is certainly human readable, and would be a quick and simple solution that should suffice for most purposes that I can imagine.",
