    "body": "We currently have the functions `save_operator` and `load_operator` in `utils/_operator_utils.py`. Yes, I was envisioning simply adding an option to these which allows using whatever is returned by `str(operator)`. It seems that's also what @jarrodmcc was suggesting, so I think we can go ahead with that, @quid256 , if you like.",
